END_PGML

##########
# Solution
##########

BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION
With [`\frac{14}{42}\text{,}`] we have [`\frac{2\cdot7}{2\cdot3\cdot7}\text{,}`] which reduces to [`\frac{1}{3}\text{.}`]

END_PGML_SOLUTION

Section::End();

#########
